{"unit_id":"KLRSL__dsh-fuse#card-zh","repo":"KLRSL/dsh-fuse","commit":"5f610231e3b915dec9ea9531b07bf0a826a447e4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fuse 是面向 DSH Web 对话的页面渲染插件。它向系统提示词加入 dsh-fuse JSON 围栏规范，并在聊天代码块中把规格转成可交互页面。页面可包含仪表盘、表格、表单、登录注册、个人卡片等结构，也能使用主题令牌、动作回传和桌面手机宽度预览。用户可将预览导出为独立 HTML 文件，适合需要在对话中快速生成页面原型或小型界面的场景；无需额外 API 密钥，主题配置通过本机插件接口提供。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:54-61","lib/client.js:948-988"]}
{"unit_id":"KLRSL__dsh-fuse#card-en","repo":"KLRSL/dsh-fuse","commit":"5f610231e3b915dec9ea9531b07bf0a826a447e4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-fuse turns JSON specifications in DSH web chats into interactive pages such as dashboards, forms, and tables. It adds the fence format to the system prompt. Users can preview desktop or phone widths, trigger session actions from controls, and export standalone HTML. No extra API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:54-61","lib/client.js:948-988"]}
